{"seq":2,"slug":"build-test-speed","title":"构建、测试与反馈速度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-experience-engineering/innerloop/build-test-speed","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建-测试与反馈速度\">构建、测试与反馈速度</h1><p>把一个改动从「写完」到「确认它对了」之间的等待时间画成一条时间线，你会看到几段堆叠的延迟：编译、测试、热重载、有时还要跑一遍 lint。开发者一天要走过这条时间线几百次。本篇把这条时间线逐段拆开，讲清每一段的延迟从何而来、又能用什么手段把它从分钟级压回秒级——这是 <a href=\"../foundations/friction-flow-feedback\">摩擦、心流与反馈循环</a> 中那个反馈循环支柱最具体的落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内环反馈的总延迟是几段串行等待之和，优化它的第一原则是：先量再砍，且优先砍跨过「触发上下文切换」阈值的那段。把总等待压到 1 秒以内，开发者根本不会出戏；压到 10 秒以内，尚能维持；一旦超过，心流就开始流失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EDIT[改一行代码]&#10;  BUILD[构建/编译&lt;br/&gt;增量·缓存可大幅压缩]&#10;  TEST[测试&lt;br/&gt;选择性执行·并行]&#10;  HMR[热重载&lt;br/&gt;不重启即见效]&#10;  RESULT[看到结果]&#10;  EDIT --&gt; BUILD&#10;  BUILD --&gt; TEST&#10;  TEST --&gt; HMR&#10;  HMR --&gt; RESULT&#10;  RESULT --&gt; EDIT\">flowchart TD\n  EDIT[改一行代码]\n  BUILD[构建/编译&lt;br/&gt;增量·缓存可大幅压缩]\n  TEST[测试&lt;br/&gt;选择性执行·并行]\n  HMR[热重载&lt;br/&gt;不重启即见效]\n  RESULT[看到结果]\n  EDIT --&gt; BUILD\n  BUILD --&gt; TEST\n  TEST --&gt; HMR\n  HMR --&gt; RESULT\n  RESULT --&gt; EDIT</pre><p>下表给出各段延迟的常见成因与对应手段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟段</th>\n<th>常见成因</th>\n<th>关键手段</th>\n<th>反馈目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建/编译</td>\n<td>全量重编、无缓存</td>\n<td>增量编译、构建缓存、远程缓存</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>全量跑、串行、慢测试</td>\n<td>受影响测试选择、并行、分层</td>\n<td>秒到十几秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热重载</td>\n<td>重启整个进程</td>\n<td>HMR、热更新、保留状态</td>\n<td>亚秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查</td>\n<td>提交时才跑 lint/类型</td>\n<td>编辑器内实时、增量类型检查</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化内环-先找瓶颈再动手\">量化内环：先找瓶颈再动手</h2><p>优化内环最常见的错误是凭直觉砍。正确的第一步是测量：在真实工作流里记录每一段实际花多久，找出占大头的那一段。一个简化的优化收益模型很有说服力——设某段延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每天触发 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次，把它压缩为原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;k&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），则一天节省约：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = n \\cdot t_i \\cdot (1 - k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 在内环里动辄成百上千，哪怕只把最大的那段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 砍掉一半，节省都相当可观；反之去优化一段本就只占几百毫秒的环节，乘再大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 也是边角料。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/measuring-dx\">度量 DX：DORA 与 SPACE</a> 的精神一致：先有数据，再有动作。</p>\n<p>这里有个必须守住的边界：优化内环不等于放松正确性。把受影响测试选择做得过窄，可能漏掉依赖图之外的真实回归；缓存做错了输入哈希，会把陈旧产物当成新的。二者表面省了时间，代价却是把问题推给更晚、更贵的环节（甚至线上）。所以这些手段的默认配置应当保守，宁可在命中率上留一点余量，也不要为了快而牺牲可信度。</p>\n<p>内环优化同样需要度量来防止自欺：开发者对「构建慢」的主观抱怨，未必对应真实的大头。用一小段时间记录每段延迟的真实耗时，往往会发现被抱怨最多的环节其实只占小头，而某个不起眼的步骤才是瓶颈。以数据而非印象排序，才能把有限的人力花在真正影响体验的那一段上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建-增量与缓存\">构建：增量与缓存</h2><p>构建是内环里最常见的大头。压缩它有三层递进手段。第一层是增量编译——只重编受改动影响的部分，而非全量重来；现代编译器与构建系统大多支持，关键是别用配置把它关掉。第二层是构建缓存——把编译产物按输入哈希缓存，输入没变就直接命中，连编都省了。第三层是远程/共享缓存——把缓存放到团队共享的存储里，一个人构出的产物全队复用，CI 也能命中，这在大型单仓里收益尤其惊人。</p>\n<p>Bazel、Turborepo、Gradle 等系统都以「内容寻址 + 缓存」为核心卖点。它们的共同前提是构建的确定性：相同输入必须产生相同输出，缓存才可信。这一点又呼应了 <a href=\"local-dev-environments\">本地开发环境与一致性</a>——环境不一致会破坏确定性，缓存随之失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试-从全量到选择性\">测试：从全量到选择性</h2><p>测试套件随项目增长而膨胀，跑一遍从几秒涨到几十分钟，是内环反馈劣化最典型的轨迹。对策同样分层。最有效的是受影响测试选择（test impact analysis）：根据改动文件的依赖图，只跑可能被影响的那部分测试，把内环测试量砍到极小。其次是并行执行，把测试分散到多核或多机。再次是测试分层——把快的单元测试放在内环、慢的集成与端到端测试推到外环（CI 或合并前），别让慢测试拖累每一次保存。</p>\n<p>还有一个常被忽视的维度是测试的稳定性。脆弱测试（flaky test，时绿时红）对反馈的破坏极大：它让开发者不敢相信红色、养成「重跑一次试试」的坏习惯，既浪费时间又侵蚀信任。治理脆弱测试和压缩测试时长同等重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热重载与编辑器内反馈\">热重载与编辑器内反馈</h2><p>最短的反馈循环根本不需要离开编辑器。热重载（HMR）让前端改动不重启、不丢状态地即时反映到界面；编辑器内的实时类型检查与 lint 让错误在敲键时就标红，而不必等到构建。这一类反馈把延迟压到亚秒甚至即时，是心流的最佳保镖——开发者的注意力从不需要离开手头的代码。</p>\n<p>把这些手段叠起来，一个理想的内环是这样的：保存即触发增量编译（命中缓存则近乎瞬时），只跑受影响的少数测试，结果在编辑器里就地呈现，全程不超过一两秒。这种体验不会自然发生，它是被工程出来的；而工具的默认值是否倾向这种体验，是 <a href=\"tooling-ergonomics\">工具人体工学与默认值</a> 要谈的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内环总延迟是构建、测试、热重载、检查几段串行等待之和；优化首要原则是先量再砍，优先砍跨过切换阈值的那段。</li>\n<li>节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = n \\cdot t_i \\cdot (1-k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 极大，砍最大段的一半远胜优化本就微小的环节。</li>\n<li>构建优化三层递进：增量编译、内容寻址缓存、团队共享的远程缓存，前提是构建确定性。</li>\n<li>测试优化靠受影响测试选择、并行、分层（快测在内环、慢测推外环），同时必须治理脆弱测试以保护信任。</li>\n<li>最短反馈来自不离开编辑器的热重载与实时检查，把延迟压到亚秒级，是心流的最佳保护。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构建、测试与反馈速度","id":"构建-测试与反馈速度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化内环：先找瓶颈再动手","id":"量化内环-先找瓶颈再动手"},{"level":2,"text":"构建：增量与缓存","id":"构建-增量与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"测试：从全量到选择性","id":"测试-从全量到选择性"},{"level":2,"text":"热重载与编辑器内反馈","id":"热重载与编辑器内反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本地开发环境与一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-experience-engineering/innerloop/local-dev-environments"},"next":{"title":"工具人体工学与默认值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-experience-engineering/innerloop/tooling-ergonomics"}}